          "title": "You'll want to know: بخشیدن",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بخشیدن — bakhshidan — \"to forgive\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bakhshidan is a native Persian word, inherited rather than borrowed: it continues Middle Persian baxš-, \"to share out, to grant\" (EtymDB). Persian uses \"to grant\" for forgiving."
            }
          ]
        },
